    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sorting</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/3sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 15</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>3Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Sort, fix the smallest number, and the rest is Two Sum on a sorted suffix: the sign of the sum tells you which pointer to move. Skip equal values at each of the three positions and duplicates never appear. O(n²) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
